      "writtenOn": "2023-08-31T13:49:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually that\u0027s not quite true. In /linkerconfig/ld.config.txt (without this change) we have\n```\nnamespace.default.link.com_android_adbd.shared_libs \u003d libadb_pairing_auth.so:libadb_pairing_connection.so:libadb_pairing_server.so\n```\n\nAnd in /apex/com.android/adbd/lib64 we do have those libraries.\n\nOTOH adb is working just fine when I remove the linkerconfig. Which suggests they aren\u0027t needed in our configuration?",
      "parentUuid": "3a28c718_470f8e93",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1,
